source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A parenthesized token consumes a backslash of the run exactly like a colon token, so the pair does not break and the token stays characters.
-- input.jira --
\\(x)
-- rendered.html --
<p>\(x)</p>
-- want.md --
\\(x)
-- warnings.json --
[]
